[92.406406, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.750839ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.296648ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(17.547918ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.62531ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.3071ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ branch labels use case-insensitive keys, not case-insensitive values \u001b[90m(0.389421ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ mixed-provisioner plans include labeled dependents and their untagged stack resources \u001b[90m(0.315816ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ labels do not absorb unrelated dependents or override explicit branch tags \u001b[90m(0.216911ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 9\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 9\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 1475.568442\u001b[39m\r\n"]
